  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Collective Initiative: SPRAVA  - Shifting Power for Resilience and Value of Local Actors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Collective Initiative addresses the needs of Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) that have emerged throughout the DEC-funded humanitarian response through re-integrating diverse vulnerabilities while shifting power back to local response actors. The Initiative will focus on civil society development and scaling up lessons learnt on sustainable partnerships strategy, while integrating a Survivor and Community-Led Response approach.</narrative>
  </description>
